const RULE_PROMPT = `You are a business logic engine. Analyze the provided input (audio or text) describing a special offer or rule.

Extract the single most prominent business rule.

Supported Rule Types:
1. "threshold_free_delivery": e.g., "Free delivery on orders over $50".
